  "description": "Additional height to existing synagogue by way of adding a pitched roof to provide a Women’s gallery. To the host property - basement side extension and further excavation to the rear lightwell; refurbishment of the existing single storey side extension and alterations to the fenestration.”",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p>The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n</p>",
    "<p>The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of this permission.</p><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\nREASON: In order to comply with the provisions of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).</p><p>\r\n</p>",
    "&lt;p data-start=&quot;287&quot; data-end=&quot;576&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;The soft landscaping to the front garden shall be retained. Any soft landscaping that is removed shall be replaced within the next available planting season with species of a similar size and character, unless otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;290&quot; data-end=&quot;643&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;578&quot; data-end=&quot;824&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-start=&quot;578&quot; data-end=&quot;589&quot;&gt;REASON&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;To preserve the contribution of soft landscaping to the character and appearance of the property&amp;nbsp;and to support biodiversity.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
